Every optional permission can be refused, and Keyvy works without it. You can withdraw any of them at any time in your phone's Settings.

Deleting your data

There is no data held anywhere but your phone, so there is nothing to request or erase from us. To remove everything: turn off the wallpaper blur to delete the captured image, clear Keyvy's storage in your phone's app settings, or uninstall Keyvy.

Children

Keyvy is a general-purpose launcher. It does not collect personal information from anyone, including children.

Changes

If this policy changes, the date at the top changes with it. Material changes will be noted in the app's release notes.

